WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:04.200
In Lille, a reader of French
opens your onboarding page,

2
00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:06.590
and the animation's words are English.

3
00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:11.990
The words are text inside its .lottie
file, and only an English file exists.

4
00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:15.300
General Translation
translates Lottie animations

5
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:19.510
with npx gt stage and npx gt download.

6
00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:24.910
List the animations and the
fonts they use in gt.config.json.

7
00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:30.200
After you sign in and set your
project ID, run npx gt stage,

8
00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.050
which uploads the fonts first.

9
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:36.600
Run npx gt download until the
Spanish and French files are saved,

10
00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:38.510
and review them before you publish.

11
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.050
In Lille, the same animation
plays in Spanish and in French,

12
00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:44.830
at its English font size.
